M6LWlvZxz7TCOar-su94JEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSx0cmj4izXiYxGEs2NO2c4ZSbhf0cSuQpnBdyD0B-W8w&oe=6AEDFEBB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance is the official virtual reality training application for the ImmerseLearn HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. Designed to complement instructor-led and online learning, this immersive simulation enables learners to develop practical chiller inspection and maintenance skills in a safe, interactive environment.\n\nThrough realistic hands-on scenarios, learners practice chiller inspection procedures, preventive maintenance tasks, component identification, safety protocols, operational checks, system monitoring, and basic troubleshooting techniques while following industry best practices.\n\nImportant: This application is not a standalone training product. It is available exclusively to individuals enrolled in the ImmerseLearn HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. Only authorized learners with program access can use this application as part of their required hands-on VR training.", "short_description": "HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance is the VR hands-on training application for the ImmerseLearn HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. This application is intended exclusively for enrolled learners and provides immersive, real-world practice in chiller inspection, preventive maintenance, safety procedures, and troubleshooting. Access is available only to users enrolled in the ImmerseLearn program."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": 